{"generated": "2026-11-01 00:35", "brief": "<b>1. 오픈AI 자금 조달 목표 축소</b>\n빅테크 세일오프와 투자 심리 위축으로 인해 오픈AI가 당초 300억 달러 수준이던 투자 유치 목표를 약 100억~150억 달러 이상 축소했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#11</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#13</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPeWdSajhqVnN5TFJ2XzB3aEt3TzJ2TFhNamVKQnhJSlVsVVRDMENOcmJZX0ZSSTNINS1vbUplY0ZSWG1XLXoxTW1Zd1hUdWRwQ0NWNlpuRmg2eS1KMXZrR0J3cVBVaFF2VE9KYTF3VE5mX2pEMHNCWGJZZlVHc0xGSGFQa2FSb1RXeE5HV19JaVJxbTNacTNhZFJMWndpWWpXU3RjVktQM0tTMnRiQ04zNjZ0cw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#21</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#29</a>]. 이는 AI 업계 전반의 자금 조달 문턱이 높아지고 기업가치 목표 또한 하향 조정되는 시장 경색 상황을 보여줍니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE11LVFaZUZuS2FTamNISExXOEROeHpBVEhTYWlrWmR3V2Q4V05XX0pWaHJOb2lrelZnS3lBQi1kRTU5Z2hxWWROLVJjMng1X21DZWlVNTE2YnZlS2JtM0FPZm9abzFHZExO?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#2</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#11</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#29</a>].\n\n<b>2. 앤트로픽 IPO 난항 및 신사업 타개책</b>\n주요 생성형 AI 기업인 앤트로픽이 IPO를 추진 중이나, 대규모 손실 우려와 상장 후 정크등급 평가는 물론 각종 시장 리스크에 직면해 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1JVFBGc1dYWnZYa2VoaHlpNzYxeGVRbHhCVTZEczFHZG9rZjRlYzJYcDduRV9JRDdjY2pCbFF4M0JjaG9uR2FGNDk3cVhJWEo4VW1obXBEYm9BTlU?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#5</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQLWV6RXhjZ2xUMjBhd3dDUkJlNjEzRXhzZmJyLUZuV3poSWpHYUFIa2E0Vk1lZ3hLLUllVW1rUk1ib2Q0SU9kdGhPWnFRYjRZSDkyTXdwTUsyX1VuSUVwRzd1dnMzQ2pRbW9uQ1dUSVZqS0RJSm5iU3dCSndkUmYwU25B?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#26</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNT0ZodG1YYjRZa21FVzlRSEJp